            "date": "Aug 13, 2024",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "quote-2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Raz is the streetwise and spiritual Five Percenter, a loop-digging auteur…",
            "outlet": "Pitchfork",
            "date": "Apr 22, 2025",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "quote-3": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Effortlessly self-assured, Fresco makes a showcase of every second.",
            "outlet": "Bandcamp Daily",
            "date": "Jul 10, 2026",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "quote-4": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Raz Fresco is Toronto’s most studious rapper. He brings a wealth of substance to a genre that is often cited as lacking just that. [..] Sitting down with the 20-year-old for a few hours is just as entertaining as it is an intellectual refresher.",
            "outlet": "Complex",
            "date": "Jul 2015",
            "url": ""
          }
        }
      },
